[ID TC002] Testing: Which brand generated the highest total net revenue in 2023?
Determined intent: data_handler
Instantiated handler: DataHandler
[DataHandler] Tables identified: {'FACT_Interactions', 'DIM_Brand', 'FACT_Sales', 'DIM_Time'}
[DataHandler] SQL Generated: SELECT 
    DB.brand_name, 
    SUM(FS.net_revenue_eur) AS total_net_revenue
FROM 
    FACT_Sales FS
JOIN 
    DIM_Brand DB ON FS.brand_id = DB.brand_id
JOIN 
    DIM_Time DT ON FS.time_id = DT.time_id
WHERE 
    DT.year = 2023
GROUP BY 
    DB.brand_name
ORDER BY 
    total_net_revenue DESC
LIMIT 1;
